  m_text: '

    <b>Controls:</b>\t\t <i>Keyboard+Mouse</i>\t <i>GamePad</i>

    Escape:
    \t\t\t Escape Key \t Start

    Rotate/Zoom Camera: \t WASD/Arrows \t Left Stick

    Flip
    Camera: \t\t F \t\t Y/Triangle

    Aim: \t\t\t Mouse \t\t Right Stick

    Fire:
    \t\t\t Left Click \t Right Trigger

    Cancel: \t\t\t Right Click \t B/Circle'
